# Chezmoi Exclude Patterns
# Files that should NOT be tracked in the dotfiles repo

README.md

# Neovim
**/lazy-lock.json
**/lazyvim.json
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/test.*

# Zsh
**/dot_zcompdump*
**/.zcompdump*
**/*.zwc
**/private_dot_zhistory
**/private_dot_zsh_history

# Zim framework (let it install itself)
**/dot_zim/

# Machine- and context-specific local shell overrides should stay off-repo.
dot_config/zsh/local.zsh

# Build artifacts
**/*.o
**/*.so
**/*.a

# IDE
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# OS-specific
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Pi coding agent — secrets (never track API keys)
**/auth.json

# Pi coding agent — sessions are dynamic data tied to working dirs
**/sessions/

# Pi coding agent — settings.json is managed by pi (lastChangelogVersion, model selection, etc.)
**/settings.json

# Pi coding agent — local/generated state under ~/.config/pi/agent, not source-of-truth config
# Skills live in ~/.agents/skills/ (synced from dot_agents/skills/). Pi's native
# config dir ~/.pi/agent/skills/ is symlinked to it by dot_config/scripts/run_once_symlink_pi_skills.sh.
dot_config/pi/agent/bin/
